{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101763","id":2285716330,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6IPUNq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101763","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101763.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101763.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101763","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101763/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101763/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101763/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/17423e9899f70682db4f4077afa0497a9d971b0d","number":101763,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Windows] Fix left/right Shift key regression","user":{"login":"SupSuper","id":603444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMzQ0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/603444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper","html_url":"https://github.com/SupSuper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SupSuper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This fixes a regression introduced in #92415 and reported in #101384.\r\n\r\nWhen multiple Shift keys are pressed, Windows only sends a KEYUP for the last key released, leaving the other stuck pressed. A workaround was introduced in #80231 to fake this missing KEYUP event.\r\nHowever this workaround was broken in #92415. _get_mods() returns the modifier keys *before* the KEYUP, so there will always be a Shift key pressed before it's released.\r\n\r\nThis PR restores the original check and respective functionality. The MRP in #101384 can be used to reproduce and confirm the fix.\r\n\r\nThanks to @ghostsoft @andyprice @romlok for helping debug the issue.\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, fixes: #101384*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_